{
  "category": "Scorching Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "In the fever of an exciting battle, it showers embers from the gaps between its feathers and takes to the air.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "When attacking prey, it can reach speeds of up to 310 mph. It finishes its prey off with a colossal kick.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the fever of an exciting battle, it showers embers from the gaps between its feathers and takes to the air.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When attacking prey, it can reach speeds of up to 310 mph. It finishes its prey off with a colossal kick.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its favorite foods are Wingull and Pikipek. It attacks with a powerful kick and grasps them firmly in its talons.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It zooms directly at its prey at flight speeds of close to 310 mph, while fiery embers scatter from gaps in its feathers.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its tough wings don’t allow fire to pass through them. A long time ago, firefighters’ outfits were made from Talonflame wings.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bird Pokémon make up most of its diet. It approaches at high speeds and smacks them down to the ground with its powerful kick.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Talonflame mainly preys upon other bird Pokémon. To intimidate opponents, it sends embers spewing from gaps between its feathers.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Talonflame dives toward prey at speeds of up to 310 mph and assaults them with powerful kicks, giving the prey no chance to escape.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
